tabsira-014.en:
For knowledge is attained only through earnestness, resolve, strength and firmness, as the Exalted said: «O Yaḥyā, take the Book with strength» (Q. 19:12). And the poet said:
Devote yourself to books and study / you will win the glory of prophethood;
for Allah said to Yaḥyā: / «Take the Book with strength» (Q. 19:12).

rihlat-087.en:
But as for women: if they remain / in the midst of the tent all their days, they are not blamed;
«And stay in your houses» (Q. 33:33) came down / in his blessed age, the word of Him who is on high;
… / …
So Sawda stayed until death, and neither / went on hajj nor went on campaign, and she voiced wise words [?].
